[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ……暇だなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh*... So boooored..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様。こんなところにいたのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is where you were."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、ベップ。見回り？\u3000お疲れ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, making your rounds?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様、やっぱり元気がないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're still feeling down, aren't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、久々にがっつり怒られちゃったからね\n気分も落ち込むっていうか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I did get quite the scolding for the first time in a while. It's hard not to feel a bit down..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しばらく謹慎だっていうから、\n特にやることもないし、暇で暇で",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm grounded for a while, so there's nothing to do. I'm just dying of boredom."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アトリエには行かないの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why not visit the atelier?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "万が一バレたら火に油だからさ……\nしばらくは大人しくしてようかなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If I got caught, it'd just add fuel to the fire... I think I'll lay low for a while."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "動物鳴き声クイズでもする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you like to guess an animal sound?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んー。気分的にはもうちょい激しいのがいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. I'm in the mood for something a bit more energetic."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、私が元気の出る踊りを踊ってあげる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I'll perform my special cheer-up dance for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "たらららら～♪",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "La la la la la ♪"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお！\u3000今日は一段と動きがキレてる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh! Your moves are especially sharp today!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...How was that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ、ありがと。ちょっと元気出た",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, thanks. I'm feeling a bit better now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様が私を心配して来てくれたこと、嬉しかった。\nだから、落ち込まないで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was happy that you came to help because you were worried about me. So please don't be sad."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん。優しいベップ、すき",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah. You're so sweet. I love you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ、無職だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh look, it's the unemployed one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シトリン！\u3000きらい！\nアタシは無職じゃなくて、謹慎中なだけ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine! I hate you! I'm not unemployed, I'm just grounded!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ、そうだったっけバレリーナくん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, is that so, little ballerina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナな。誰が踊り子じゃい。で、何か用？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's Alvina. Who're you calling a dancer? What do you want?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、別に。大聖堂に用があって来てみたら、\nたまたま君たちを見かけただけだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nothing really. I had business at the Grand Cathedral and just happened to spot you two."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大聖堂に？\u3000あんたが？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You? At the Grand Cathedral?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "例の水不足の解決策について案がまとまったからね。\n神官長に許可をもらってくるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've put together a solution for that water shortage problem. I'm going to get the High Priest's approval."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "にゃにぃ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これが認められれば、大きな稼ぎになる。\nふふ、今から楽しみだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If this gets approved, it'll be quite profitable. Hehe, I can hardly wait."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "儲かったら、君にもお菓子くらい奢ってあげるよ。\nじゃあね、バイバイ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If I make enough, I might even treat you to some sweets. Well then, bye-bye!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐぬぬ……先を越されたー！\u3000ベップ～～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grrrr... They beat me to it! Beeeeepp~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よしよし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There, there..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]